(134,'O Brother, Where Art Thou?',26000000,'','In the deep south during the 1930s, three escaped convicts search for hidden treasure while a relentless lawman pursues them. On their journey they come across many comical characters and incredible situations. Based upon Homer\'s \'Odyssey\'.',39.742009,'2000-08-30',71868327,106,'Released','They have a plan...but not a clue.',7.30,1112),
