(149,'アキラ',8000000,'http://www.bandaivisual.co.jp/akira/','Childhood friends Tetsuo and Kaneda are pulled into the post-apocalyptic underworld of Neo-Tokyo and forced to fight for their very survival. Kaneda is a bike gang leader, and Tetsuo is a member of a tough motorcycle crew who becomes involved in a covert government project called Akira. But a bloody battle ensues when Kaneda sets out to save his friend.',39.338097,'1988-07-16',553171,124,'Released','Neo-Tokyo is about to E.X.P.L.O.D.E.',7.80,773),
