(161,'Ocean\'s Eleven',85000000,'http://www.warnerbros.co.uk/movies/oceans-eleven','Less than 24 hours into his parole, charismatic thief Danny Ocean is already rolling out his next plan: In one night, Danny\'s hand-picked crew of specialists will attempt to steal more than $150 million from three Las Vegas casinos. But to score the cash, Danny risks his chances of reconciling with ex-wife, Tess.',60.929352,'2001-12-07',450717150,116,'Released','Are you in or out?',7.20,3783),
