(1415,'Party Monster',5000000,'','The New York club scene of the 80s and 90s was a world like no other. Into this candy-colored, mirror ball playground stepped Michael Alig, a wannabe from nowhere special. Under the watchful eye of veteran club kid James St. James, Alig quickly rose to the top... and there was no place to go but down.',4.129165,'2003-09-05',742898,98,'Released','\'Til death do they party...',5.90,58),
