(4105,'Black Rain',30000000,'','Two New York cops get involved in a gang war between members of the Yakuza, the Japanese Mafia. They arrest one of their killers and are ordered to escort him back to Japan. In Japan, however, he manages to escape. As they try to track him down, they get deeper and deeper into the Japanese Mafia scene and they have to learn that they can only win by playing the game the Japanese way.',11.196020,'1989-09-22',45892212,125,'Released','Their country. Their laws. Their game. His rules.',6.20,243),
(4107,'Bloody Sunday',0,'','The dramatised story of the Irish civil rights protest march on January 30 1972 which ended in a massacre by British troops.',7.330691,'2002-01-16',773228,107,'Released','',7.20,53),
