(4244,'The Kid',65000000,'http://movies.disney.com/the-kid','Powerful businessman Russ Duritz is self-absorbed and immersed in his work. But by the magic of the moon, he meets Rusty, a chubby, charming 8-year-old version of himself who can\'t believe he could turn out so badly -- with no life and no dog. With Rusty\'s help, Russ is able to reconcile the person he used to dream of being with the man he\'s actually become.',18.281798,'2000-07-07',69700000,104,'Released','Nobody ever grows up quite like they imagined.',6.00,238),
