(5852,'Angel Eyes',53000000,'http://angeleyesmovie.warnerbros.com/index_noflash.html','A story about a seemingly unlikely couple who cross paths under life-threatening circumstances as though they are destined not only to meet but to save each other\'s lives. Not once, but twice.',6.454634,'2001-05-15',29700000,102,'Released','The deeper you look, the more you will find.',5.60,88),
