(8077,'Alien³',50000000,'','After escaping with Newt and Hicks from the alien planet, Ripley crash lands on Fiorina 161, a prison planet and host to a correctional facility. Unfortunately, although Newt and Hicks do not survive the crash, a more unwelcome visitor does. The prison does not allow weapons of any kind, and with aid being a long time away, the prisoners must simply survive in any way they can.',45.856409,'1992-05-22',159773545,114,'Released','The bitch is back.',6.20,1633),
