(8456,'Never Back Down',20000000,'http://www.neverbackdownthemovie.com/','Rebellious Jake Tyler is lured into an ultimate underground fight Scene at his new high school, after receiving threats to the safety of his friends and family Jake decides to seek the mentoring of a veteran fighter who trains him for one final no-holds-barred elimination fight with his nemesis and local martial arts champion Ryan McCarthy.',26.214250,'2008-03-04',41627431,115,'Released','Win or lose... Everyone has their fight.',6.40,497),
