(8842,'Against the Ropes',39000000,'','A fictional story inspired by North America\'s most famous female boxing promoter, Jackie Kallen. Her struggle to survive and succeed in a male dominated sport.',2.817364,'2004-02-20',6614280,106,'Released','',4.50,32),
