(9466,'Celebrity',0,'','The career and personal life of writer Lee are at a standstill, so he divorces his bashful wife, Robin, and dives into a new job as an entertainment journalist. His assignments take him to the swankiest corners of Manhattan, but as he jumps from one lavish party to another and engages in numerous empty romances, he starts to doubt the worth of his work. Meanwhile, top TV producer Tony falls for Robin and introduces her to the world of celebrity.',7.594593,'1998-09-07',0,113,'Released','A funny look at people who will do anything to get famous... or stay famous.',6.00,111),
