(9662,'Les triplettes de Belleville',8000000,'http://www.sonyclassics.com/triplets/','When her grandson is kidnapped during the Tour de France, Madame Souza and her beloved pooch Bruno team up with the Belleville Sisters--an aged song-and-dance team from the days of Fred Astaire--to rescue him.',13.944645,'2003-06-11',1477676,80,'Released','',7.30,231),
