(9683,'Bubble Boy',0,'','Jimmy is young man who was born without an immune system and has lived his life within a plastic bubble in his bedroom... who pines for the sweet caresses of girl-next-door Chloe. But when Chloe decides to marry her high school boyfriend, Jimmy -- bubble suit and all -- treks cross-country to stop her. Swoosie Kurtz, as Jimmy\'s overprotective mom, co-stars along with Fabio, who portrays the leader of a religious cult.',10.131123,'2001-08-24',0,84,'Released','Life is an adventure. Don\'t blow it.',5.10,163),
