(9725,'Friday the 13th Part 2',1250000,'','Five years after the horrible bloodbath at Camp Crystal Lake, it seems Jason Voorhees and his demented mother are in the past. Paul opens up a new camp close to the infamous site, ignoring warnings to stay away, and a sexually-charged group of counselors follow -- including child psychologist major Ginny. But Jason has been hiding out all this time, and now he\'s ready for revenge.',16.517777,'1981-05-01',21722776,87,'Released','The body count continues...',6.00,315),
