(9792,'The Hills Have Eyes',15000000,'http://www.foxsearchlight.com/thehillshaveeyes/','Based on Wes Craven\'s 1977 suspenseful cult classic, The Hills Have Eyes is the story of a family road trip that goes terrifyingly awry when the travelers become stranded in a government atomic zone. Miles from nowhere, the Carter family soon realizes the seemingly uninhabited wasteland is actually the breeding ground of a blood-thirsty mutant family...and they are the prey.',35.107857,'2006-03-10',69623713,107,'Released','The lucky ones die first.',6.10,705),
