(9900,'Grandma\'s Boy',0,'','Even though he\'s 35, Alex acts more like he\'s 13, spending his days as the world\'s oldest video game tester and his evenings developing the next big Xbox game. But he gets kicked out of his apartment and is forced to move in with his grandmother.',9.974681,'2006-01-06',6538177,94,'Released','A movie that proves you\'re never too old to come of age.',6.60,220),
(9902,'Wrong Turn',12600000,'','Chris crashes into a carload of other young people, and the group of stranded motorists is soon lost in the woods of West Virginia, where they\'re hunted by three cannibalistic mountain men who are grossly disfigured by generations of inbreeding.',33.555764,'2003-05-30',28650575,84,'Released','It\'s the last one you\'ll ever take.',6.00,635),
