(10197,'Nine',80000000,'http://nine-movie.com/','Arrogant, self-centered movie director Guido Contini finds himself struggling to find meaning, purpose, and a script for his latest film endeavor. With only a week left before shooting begins, he desperately searches for answers and inspiration from his wife, his mistress, his muse, and his mother.',9.357734,'2009-12-03',53825515,112,'Released','This Holiday Season, Be Italian',5.10,165),
