(10555,'Shark Tale',75000000,'','Oscar is a small fish whose big aspirations often get him into trouble. Meanwhile, Lenny is a great white shark with a surprising secret that no sea creature would guess: He\'s a vegetarian. When a lie turns Oscar into an improbable hero and Lenny becomes an outcast, the two form an unlikely friendship.',47.094369,'2004-09-20',367275019,90,'Released','The story of what happens when one little fish tells a great white lie...',5.80,1557),
