(10571,'Boys and Girls',16000000,'','Ryan and Jennifer are opposites who definitely do not attract. At least that\'s what they always believed. When they met as twelve-year-olds, they disliked one another. When they met again as teenagers, they loathed each other. But when they meet in college, the uptight Ryan and the free-spirited Jennifer find that their differences bind them together and a rare friendship develops.',9.119797,'2000-06-16',20627372,94,'Released','Warning: Sex Changes Everything',5.40,103),
