(11363,'She\'s the One',3500000,'','Mickey, a free-spirited New York cabbie, and Francis, a materialistic Wall Street stockbroker, are extremely competitive and confused about women as a result of their father\'s influence. Though they disagree about everything, they have one thing in common: Mickey\'s ex-fiance Heather is Francis\'s secret love. Though both brothers have beautiful wives, Heather triggers their longtime sibling rivalry',8.406025,'1996-08-26',9482579,96,'Released','A romantic comedy about two brothers... and the one thing that came between them.',5.70,70),
