(11699,'The Bad Lieutenant: Port of Call - New Orleans',25000000,'','Terrence McDonagh, a New Orleans Police sergeant, who starts out as a good cop, receiving a medal and a promotion to lieutenant for heroism during Hurricane Katrina. During his heroic act, McDonagh injures his back and later becomes addicted to prescription pain medication. McDonagh finds himself involved with a drug dealer who is suspected of murdering a family of African immigrants.',17.339852,'2009-09-11',10589102,122,'Released','The only criminal he can\'t catch is himself.',6.00,326),
