(11775,'Intolerable Cruelty',60000000,'','A revenge-seeking gold digger marries a womanizing Beverly Hills lawyer with the intention of making a killing in the divorce.',22.620125,'2003-09-02',119940815,100,'Released','They can\'t keep their hands off each others assets.',5.80,391),
