(11802,'Space Chimps',37000000,'http://www.spacechimpspower.com/','Circus monkey Ham III works in a circus where he\'s regularly shot from a canon but he still lives in the shadow of his father\'s legacy. A natural born rebel against authority, Ham III is initially reluctant to go on a dangerous space mission to rescue a lost space probe, but away he goes, for lots of RIGHT STUFF-style astro-training alongside two highly prepared chimps, Luna and Titan.',6.293217,'2008-07-17',63800345,81,'Released','Houston, we have a problem!',5.20,99),
