(11908,'Hatchet',0,'http://www.hatchetmovie.com/','When a group of tourists on a New Orleans haunted swamp tour find themselves stranded in the wilderness, their evening of fun and spooks turns into a horrific nightmare.',12.677016,'2006-04-27',0,83,'Released','Stay out of the swamp.',5.70,159),
