(12096,'The Pink Panther',0,'','When the coach of the France soccer team is killed by a poisoned dart in the stadium in the end of a game, and his expensive and huge ring with the diamond Pink Panther disappears, the ambitious Chief Inspector Dreyfus assigns the worst police inspector Jacques Clouseau to the case.',25.450534,'2006-01-18',0,93,'Released','Pardon His French.',5.60,550),
