(12103,'Don\'t Say a Word',50000000,'','When the daughter of a psychiatrist is kidnapped, he\'s horrified to discover that the abductors\' demand is that he break through to a post traumatic stress disorder suffering young woman who knows a secret..',11.596207,'2001-09-28',100020092,113,'Released','...I\'ll never tell.',6.00,220),
