(13820,'Repo Man',1500000,'','A down and out young punk gets a job working with a seasoned repo man, but what awaits him in his new career is a series of outlandish adventures revolving around aliens, the CIA, and a most wanted \'64 Chevy.',11.353440,'1984-02-20',2300000,92,'Released','It’s 4 a.m. Do you know where your car is?',6.70,144),
