(13853,'The Clan of the Cave Bear',15000000,'','Natural changes have the clans moving. Iza, medicine woman of the \"Clan of the Cave Bear\" finds little Ayla from the \"others\"\' clan - tradition would have the clan kill Ayla immediately, but Iza insists on keeping her. When the little one finds a most needed new cave, she\'s allowed to stay - and thrive.',5.484679,'1986-01-17',0,98,'Released','At The Dawn Of Mankind, A Woman Led The Way.',4.80,27),
