(15511,'VeggieTales: The Pirates Who Don\'t Do Anything',0,'','Set Sail For Adventure! A boatload of beloved VeggieTales pals embark on a fun and fresh pirate adventure with their trademark humor and silly songs in The Pirates Who Don\'t Do Anything - A VeggieTales Movie! Larry the Cucumber, Mr. Lunt and Pa Grape find themselves on the ride of their lives when they are mysteriously whisked back to the time when pirates ruled the high seas.',1.800119,'2008-01-11',0,85,'Released','',5.90,25),
