(17339,'Force 10 from Navarone',5000000,'','Mallory and Miller are back. The survivors of Navarone are sent on a mission along with a unit called Force 10, which is led by Colonel Barnsby. But Force 10 has a mission of their own which the boys know nothing about.',5.348446,'1978-11-01',7230000,118,'Released','',6.40,91),
(17345,'Flywheel',0,'','Jay Austin wants to sell you a used car, but watch out! Many victims have fallen prey to his smiling face and hasty promises. Austin does everything his way until his dishonesty and manipulation are exposed. Like many men, he becomes disgusted by the masks he wears and the lies he tells. In every man\'s life, there can be a turning point. When Jay makes his turn, he never looks back.',1.048524,'2003-01-01',0,120,'Released','',6.80,19),
