(18276,'Hoot',0,'','A young man (Lerman) moves from Montana to Florida with his family, where he\'s compelled to engage in a fight to protect a population of endangered owls.',7.712206,'2006-05-05',0,91,'Released','It\'s time to stand up for the little guys.',5.50,44),
