(23827,'Paranormal Activity',15000,'http://www.paranormalactivity-movie.com/','After a young, middle class couple moves into a suburban \'starter\' tract house, they become increasingly disturbed by a presence that may or may not be somehow demonic but is certainly most active in the middle of the night. Especially when they sleep. Or try to.',47.456823,'2007-09-14',193355800,86,'Released','What Happens When You Sleep?',5.90,1316),
