(62214,'Frankenweenie',39000000,'http://movies.disney.com/frankenweenie-2012','When a car hits young Victor\'s pet dog Sparky, Victor decides to bring him back to life the only way he knows how. But when the bolt-necked \"monster\" wreaks havoc and terror in the hearts of Victor\'s neighbors, he has to convince them that Sparky\'s still the good, loyal friend he was.',27.908783,'2012-10-04',35287788,87,'Released','The electrifying dog is back from beyond the grave',6.60,932),
