(68734,'Argo',44500000,'http://argothemovie.warnerbros.com/','As the Iranian revolution reaches a boiling point, a CIA \'exfiltration\' specialist concocts a risky plan to free six Americans who have found shelter at the home of the Canadian ambassador.',62.010560,'2012-10-11',232324128,120,'Released','The movie was fake. The mission was real.',7.10,3423),
