(82533,'Damsels in Distress',0,'http://www.sonyclassics.com/damselsindistress/','A trio of beautiful girls set out to revolutionize life at a grungy American university: the dynamic leader Violet Wister, principled Rose and sexy Heather. They welcome transfer student Lily into their group which seeks to help severely depressed students with a program of good hygiene and musical dance numbers.',3.750338,'2012-04-06',0,99,'Released','For these girls... it\'s not what you learn, it\'s whom you educate.',5.60,67),
