(109417,'Battle of the Year',20000000,'','A down-on-his-luck coach is hired to prepare a team of the best American dancers for an international tournament that attracts all the best crews from around the world, but the Americans haven\'t won in fifteen years.',8.237336,'2013-09-21',16549477,110,'Released','The World is watching',5.90,88),
