(127585,'X-Men: Days of Future Past',250000000,'http://www.x-menmovies.com/','The ultimate X-Men ensemble fights a war for the survival of the species across two time periods as they join forces with their younger selves in an epic battle that must change the past – to save our future.',118.078691,'2014-05-15',747862775,131,'Released','To save the future, they must alter the past',7.50,6032),
