(321741,'Concussion',35000000,'http://www.sonypictures.com/movies/concussion/','A dramatic thriller based on the incredible true David vs. Goliath story of American immigrant Dr. Bennet Omalu, the brilliant forensic neuropathologist who made the first discovery of CTE, a football-related brain trauma, in a pro player and fought for the truth to be known. Omalu\'s emotional quest puts him at dangerous odds with one of the most powerful institutions in the world.',35.120736,'2015-11-12',50363790,123,'Released','Even Legends Need a Hero',7.00,823),
